# carts.conf — ROMs to bake into a filesystem image.
#
# Copy to carts.conf, drop the ROM files in carts/, and run:
#     make multicart-carts     (or videocart-carts)
# to build firmware + a filesystem image with these carts already
# installed — no web upload needed. Flash with:
#     make flash-multicart-carts
#
# If carts.conf does NOT exist, every file in carts/ is baked in with
# default metadata, so for the simple case you can skip this file
# entirely and just drop ROMs in carts/.
#
# One cart per line. Fields are '|'-separated; only the filename is
# required:
#
#   filename [| title [| autostart [| scheme [| insert]]]]
#
#   filename   relative to carts/ (letters, digits, . _ - ( ) space)
#   title      menu label (default: filename, upper-cased, ext dropped)
#   autostart  1 = boot on select (default), 0 = manual
#   scheme     flat | bank16k | auto   (default auto: >16 KB => bank16k)
#   insert     1 = insertion-style start: let BASIC boot to READY, then
#              raise CART* (needed by some cassette conversions; ~2 s
#              slower). Default 0.
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

# examples (delete these once you add real files):
# zaxxon.rom
# donkey.ccc      | Donkey Kong      | 1 | auto
# diagnostics.rom | CoCo Diagnostics | 0 | flat
